# Frontend

- Vanilla JS and custom CSS (`index.css`, `calendar.css`, `admin.css`, `hub.css`, `page.css`, `account.css`).
- Self-hosted Material Symbols Outlined woff2 from `fonts/`.
- Mobile-responsive with 44x44px touch targets.
- Auto-save with a manual save fallback.
- Support template URLs for pre-configured calendars.
- Calendar logic lives in `calendar-*.js` (core, users, grid, rank, booking, main); admin panel in `admin-*.js` (core, calendars, hubs, accounts, setup); create-page logic in `index.js`; Hub logic in `hub.js`; profile page in `account.js`.
- Every page loads `passkey.js`, then `account-core.js` (`window.Account`), before its own scripts, and starts with `await Account.require()`. API wrappers pass 401/403 responses to `Account.handleApiError()`.
- Split files are classic scripts sharing global scope, loaded in order by the page (no modules). Load-time code may only use names from its own or an earlier file; never declare the same top-level name in two files; startup runs on `DOMContentLoaded`.
